 SNMPv2-Trap PDU or an Inform PDU.  However, a particular
@@ -572,120 +644,191 @@
 information is implementation dependent.  Once the application has
 determined this information, the following procedure is performed for
 each management target:</t>
+        <ol type="(%d)" spacing="normal" indent="adaptive" start="1" pn="section-3.3-5">
+          <li pn="section-3.3-5.1">Any appropriate filtering mechanisms are applied to determine
