+              <li pn="section-3.3-5.4.4.3">The messageProcessingModel is that of the management target.</li>
+              <li pn="section-3.3-5.4.4.4">The securityModel is that of the management target.</li>
+              <li pn="section-3.3-5.4.4.5">The securityName is that of the management target.</li>
